WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:04.400
-Hey, everyone, it is Nana Week
this week on our show,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.400
in honor of my new children's
book, "Nana Loves You More."

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.868
We've been giving some love out
to all the grandmas out there,

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:12.000
all the gammies,
all the meemaws,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.734
all the bubbies, the yia-yias.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:16.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.534
Yeah, there's a lot of different
names for a nana out there.

00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:20.133
But each night this week,
we're showcasing

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.067
a talented grandma on our show.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:24.968
And tonight's talented nana is
Patsy Herb.

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:28.267
She's 72 years old and
she's from Brooklyn, New York,

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.400
and tonight,
she's going to show off

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.801
some of her dance moves for us.

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.734
Come on out here, Patsy!

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:34.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:36.767
Hey!

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:39.400
Patsy!
-How you doing?

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.300
-Thank you.
It's nice to see you.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.534
-Thank you.
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:44.367
-Thank you, thank you.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.567
-You look fantastic, Patsy.
-Thank you.

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:48.133
-Patsy, how long
have you been dancing?

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:50.400
-All my life.
-Oh, all your life.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.100
Oh, my goodness.
Since you were a baby, huh?

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.334
-You got it.
-Yeah, you got in in you.

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.367
Yeah, I hear that you have
a very special dance

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.234
that you want to perform
just for us.

00:00:57.234 --> 00:00:59.467
And I was wondering,
where did you learn this?

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:03.100
-I taught myself how to twerk.

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.100
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.434
-Be careful, Patsy.

00:01:11.434 --> 00:01:12.801
Roots, I'm excited to see this.

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:14.868
Patsy...
-But before --

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:17.434
-What? Yeah, sure.
-I have one more request.

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:18.534
-Yes?

00:01:18.534 --> 00:01:21.834
-Anybody over 65 years old
and older,

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:23.734
please don't try this at home.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.200
-Okay, there you go.
Thank you very much.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.467
Whenever you're ready.
Roots, give her a beat.

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.467
♪♪

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:32.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:42.100
-What in the world is happening?

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.834
Alright, alright.

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:46.400
Okay. Alright, alright, alright.

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:51.167
Alright. Okay.

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.868
Oh, good. Very good.
Thank you very much.

00:01:52.868 --> 00:01:54.767
Thank you very much. Patsy.

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:56.901
Patsy Herb, everybody.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:56.901 --> 00:01:58.901
Patsy Herb! Stick around.

00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:01.334
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:03.200
Oh, my -- That was...

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.801
-♪ Don't try this at home ♪

